+# docs/database.md "Queries": deleting many rows uses a single delete(...) statement.
+# Layout values: `files` and the session variable name in `constraints`.
+id: gen-no-delete-in-loop
+language: Python
+severity: error
+message: 'Delete many rows with one `delete(...)` statement, not session.delete in a loop.'
+note: 'session.exec(delete(Item).where(col(Item.owner_id) == user_id)), as delete_user in routes/users.py does.'
